@segment  comfort
@title    Comfort and Settling
@levels   F10
@duration ~40s

say Before we begin, take a moment to make yourself comfortable. Let your body rest in a way that feels supported, either lying down or seated in a chair that allows your back to relax and your shoulders to fall away from tension.
pause 4
say The goal isn't to fall asleep, but to become still enough that you could.
pause 4
